{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If mobile robot sees an object, then approach, grab, check, do task. Otherwise, scan.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = DoTask    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
